    "updated_at": "2021-10-08T13:53:58Z",
    "body": "I think the proposal would be to just dedupe `pathname` in the `file:` scheme URLs and not any other URL parts (so leaving the Windows hostname etc). @alwinb do you know if there were any remaining issues with that kind of approach offhand? It's a lot of information to digest to pick up it seems....",
