    "created_at": "2021-10-08T15:52:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-08T15:52:04Z",
    "body": "If you don't consider the hostname or windows drive letters? I don't see how there would be interactions with other parts of the URL. But it would equate more file URLs. \n\nI'd be surprised to find systems that allow empty directory names, but I would want to be careful about normalising too much. File path normalisation is quite a thing on its own. \n",
