    "updated_at": "2021-10-10T15:55:39Z",
    "body": "The quote with these examples is taken from RFC 8089: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8089#appendix-E.3.2\r\nFor example Firefox uses 5 slashes before host, when converts from UNC path:\r\n`\\\\host.example.com\\path\\to\\file` -> `file://///host.example.com/path/to/file`",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
